    "text": "hoodline.com\nwebsite\nColes County, Illinois\nFamilies Invited to Torchlight Halloween Hike at Lincoln Log Cabin State Historic Site in Coles County\nBy Jo Marquez,\n1 days agoGet ready for a blend of history and Halloween festivities at the Lincoln Log Cabin State Historic Site. On October 25, families can head over to Coles County for a torchlight Halloween hike and wiener roast. From 5 to 8 p.m., visitors can wander along paths lit by the soft glow of torches, partaking in a night of bonfires, music, and spooky stories.",
